      "https://staging.myshop.com",
      "http://localhost:3001"
    ]
  }
}

docs {
  ## PATCH /api/retailer/widget-key/:service

  Updates the **allowed origins** for the widget embed.
  Origins are account-wide (shared across all services for the retailer).

  Requests whose `Origin` header is not in this list are rejected with `403`
  before any key check — this is the primary CORS security gate.

  ### Body
  | Field          | Type     | Required | Description                                         |
  |----------------|----------|----------|-----------------------------------------------------|
  | allowedOrigins | string[] | ✅       | Full origin URLs (e.g. `https://store.com:8080`)    |

  Origins are normalized: protocol + hostname + port (no trailing slash, lowercase).

  ### Success (200)
  ```json
  {
    "isActivated": true,
    "allowedOrigins": ["https://myshop.com", "https://staging.myshop.com"]
  }
  ```
}
